WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.236
Use the Today tab to record what each learner did in every session.

00:00:09.236 --> 00:00:10.726
The symbols mean this.

00:00:10.726 --> 00:00:12.215
A star is all correct.

00:00:12.215 --> 00:00:14.179
A triangle is partly correct.

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.398
A circle is wrong.

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:19.121
Tap, What do these mean, at any time to see them again.

00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:23.413
Choose the date, then choose the subject, Math worksheets.

00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:27.687
The list shows your learners, and how many are present or absent today.

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:32.263
Tap the name of a learner to open that learner's record for the day.

00:00:33.063 --> 00:00:36.009
Choose the worksheet set that the learner is using.

00:00:36.009 --> 00:00:41.959
It does not have to match the grade of the learner, because the ARAL worksheets are not grade specific.

00:00:42.759 --> 00:00:45.844
Set the worksheet number with the plus and minus buttons.

00:00:45.844 --> 00:00:50.012
The title of the worksheet appears, so you can make sure it is the right one.

00:00:50.812 --> 00:00:55.279
Count the items that were partly correct, and the items that were wrong.

00:00:55.279 --> 00:00:58.940
If every item was correct, tap, Perfect, all items correct.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:05.558
The ARAL guide says a learner moves to the next worksheet only when every item is correct.

00:01:05.558 --> 00:01:10.147
So repeat the same worksheet until it is perfect, and record every try.

00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:12.668
The app counts the redo rounds for you.

00:01:13.468 --> 00:01:15.900
If the learner is absent, tap, Absent.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.780
Then tap, Save worksheet, to save the record.

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:25.517
When many learners did the same worksheet, tap, Log the whole group at once, and record them together.

00:01:25.517 --> 00:01:28.369
You can still change a single learner afterwards.

00:01:29.169 --> 00:01:33.178
Record each session right after it ends, so that nothing is forgotten.

00:01:33.178 --> 00:01:36.785
Your records show your learners' progress, and your daily work.
